WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Follow the task behind the total. Open Task Trace from a user's time bucket
to inspect calls, agent lanes and cumulative cost. Synthetic data only.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Clone a published release and build with dashboard/ as the context.
Configure clients, the OTel Collector, ClickHouse schemas and the authenticated dashboard.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Read one lane per agent and the cumulative cost chart.
Explore accounts for 50% of this fictional $2.50 task. Capture remains partial.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Select a call to inspect cache read, cache write, input and output tokens.
Keep token components, missing fields and cost bases separate.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
Select a model row to highlight its calls. Select it again to clear.
Codex diagnostic metrics and spans do not add to completion usage or cost.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
Choose EC2, ECS or EKS with their prerequisites. Lambda needs runtime adaptation.
Follow the installation guide in English, Korean, Japanese or Simplified Chinese.
